        <briefdescription>
<para>Verify <computeroutput>entry</computeroutput> and, if valid, add it to the catalog. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Add Entry.</para>
<para>An entry is accepted only when:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>its <computeroutput>key_fingerprint</computeroutput> resolves to an <emphasis>active</emphasis> pinned key, and</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>the Ed25519 <computeroutput>signature_b64</computeroutput> verifies against the canonical manifest JSON (<ref refid="classthemis_1_1plugins_1_1_signed_plugin_repository_1ab85be335d3011c814fb2e1145987f5c5" kindref="member">canonicalManifestJson</ref>) using that key.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>Adding an entry with the same (name, version) pair as an existing entry replaces the old entry.</para>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>entry</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Catalog entry to add. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>true on success, false if verification failed.</para>
</simplesect>
<parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">entry</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Input parameter. </para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>True when the operation succeeds.</para>
</simplesect>
Calls: lock(), verifyEntryLocked(), push_back(). </para>
